web_fill_xy:
Atomic "click + type + Enter" at screen coordinates (x,y) in one go.

Use this to avoid the common failure mode:
the agent clicks into a textbox and then gets confused about whether it has focus.

Arguments:
- x, y: coords to click
- text: what to type
- submit: press Enter after typing (default true)
- clear_first: clear before typing (default true)
- capture_snapshot: include a `browser_snapshot` immediately after action (default true)

